5,1,1,talk,Mio,,I hate doing math before turning on the lights. Let's fix this so we can just live.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I need to see the actual numbers before we agree to anything. I am not guessing.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,Who is going to do the paperwork? I don't want it to be me every month.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,The old split is broken. We need to know who is actually using what.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I just want us to stop avoiding each other over money. It’s getting weird.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Ryuji, if we don't look at the data, how do we know what's fair?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Mio, exactly. I want to see the history. I am checking the statements.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Shunichi, if we meter rooms, who reads the meters? That is a job.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, someone has to. I want to see the plug-in monitor data.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Misaki,,I will look at the payment log. I want to see where the friction is.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mio,,I will check the sunlight and heating needs. It feels unfair right now.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I will also look at the electrician's quote. I need to know the cost.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Rin,,I will look at the trial run of the reconciliation template.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I will look at the settling up when the last rooms filled.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I will look at the kitchen notice about the cooler. It shows the tension.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Mio,,Okay. Let's see what we find. I hope it’s simple.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,It rarely is. But we will know.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Rin,,I hope it doesn't take all my evenings.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,We will see.,"{""words"":3,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Misaki,,Let's just get it done.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
