60,3,1,talk,Mio,,Option A is seasonal fixed. Option B is meters. Option C is flat share.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,Option B is fair but expensive. Option A is risky given the bill swings.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Rin,,Option C is simple but unfair if usage varies. Option B is too much work.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,Option B is the only one that reflects reality. But the cost is high.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Misaki,,"Option C might be the least conflict, even if it's not perfectly fair.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Mio,,"I like the idea of meters, but the cost scares me.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,"I am worried about the 34,000 yen per room. That is 170,000 yen total.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Rin,,I can't do the monthly logging. It's too much work.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,"If we don't meter, we are just guessing. But if we do, we need to pay.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Misaki,,I think we should avoid the option that causes the most administrative burden.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Mio,,What if we do a seasonal fixed rate? It's predictable.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Ryuji,,The difference is settled at the end of the year. That could be a big bill.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Rin,,At least it's not monthly work. But the year-end bill could be huge.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,It's a compromise. But it doesn't solve the usage disparity.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Misaki,,It might be the best we can do without spending a fortune.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Mio,,I am leaning towards A. It's predictable and doesn't require meters.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Ryuji,,"I am hesitant, but B is too expensive. A is the next best thing.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Rin,,I will vote for A. I can't do the work for B.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Shunichi,,"I would prefer B, but I can't justify the cost. I will vote A.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Misaki,,I will vote A. It reduces the friction.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
